<title>GREECE: Greek M3 rises provisionally 14.8pct yr/yr in Apr.</title>
<headline>Greek M3 rises provisionally 14.8pct yr/yr in Apr.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1997-05-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Greek M3 money supply grew provisionally 14.8 percent year-on-year in April from 13.6 percent in March, overshooting the central bank's 6.0-9.0 percent target range at end-97, the Bank of Greece said.</p>
<p>M4 money supply grew provisionally 9.4 percent year-on-year in April from a revised 8.0 percent in March.</p>
</text>
